          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-industry-code-penalties-act-2014-sch-1-sec-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-industry-code-penalties-act-2014-sch-1-sec-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "deec59ec40564e9a39e792c7c79e532871a4cbc28202c7e8bf61eebd97d1fbc9",
      "skos:note": "Prescribes pecuniary penalties not exceeding 300 penalty units for civil penalty provisions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-industry-code-penalties-act-2014#sch-1-sec-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5 At the end of section 51AE",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(2) If regulations prescribe an industry code, the industry code may\nprescribe pecuniary penalties not exceeding 300 penalty units for\ncivil penalty provisions of the industry code."
    },
