      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(aaa) for each act or omission to which this section applies that\nrelates to a civil penalty provision of an industry code—the\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2014A00107\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 107, 2014\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Industry Code Penalties) Act\n\namount set out in the civil penalty provision of the industry\ncode; and\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 17 July 2014\nSenate on 1 September 2014]\n\n(163/14)\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2014A00107",
